## Security Considerations

### Wallet Authentication

- ✅ **Signature verification** - Backend verifies wallet ownership
- ✅ **Message freshness** - Standard message prevents replay attacks
- ✅ **No password storage** - Wallet signature is proof of ownership
- ❌ **Session expiration** - JWT tokens expire after 24 hours

### OAuth Authentication

- ✅ **Token verification** - Backend verifies with Google API
- ✅ **Password hashing** - bcrypt with salt rounds
- ✅ **PII encryption** - Email encrypted at rest (AES-GCM)
- ✅ **HttpOnly cookies** - JWT not accessible via JavaScript
- ✅ **HTTPS only** - Secure flag in production

### Profile Data

- ✅ **PII encryption** - Email, phone, address encrypted
- ✅ **Privacy controls** - Users control field visibility
- ✅ **Type safety** - sqlc generates type-safe database queries
- ✅ **Input validation** - Zod schemas on frontend, Go validation on backend

