## Best Practices

### ✅ DO:

- Always check onboard status before registration
- Validate signatures/tokens on backend
- Encrypt all PII data at rest
- Use HttpOnly cookies for JWT
- Clear all auth state on sign out
- Handle errors gracefully with toasts
- Use i18n for all user-facing text

### ❌ DON'T:

- Store JWT in localStorage (XSS risk)
- Skip signature verification
- Hard-code encryption keys
- Return raw PII from API
- Assume wallet/OAuth state persists
- Show raw error messages to users
- Mix authentication methods in single flow
